## Detailed Findings Log

### 1.  [CRITICAL] CORS Wildcard/Arbitrary Origin with Credentials
- **Target App:** `MikuNime_MITM` (`com.mikunime.app.id`)
- **Category:** CORS | **CVSS:** 9.1 | **CWE:** CWE-942
- **Description:** Endpoint https://adservice.google.com/getconfig/pubvendors reflects arbitrary attacker Origin with credentials enabled, allowing authenticated cross-origin data theft.
- **PoC / Vector:** `curl -I -H 'Origin: https://evil.com' https://adservice.google.com/getconfig/pubvendors`

