- **Target App:** `MikuNime_0.3.2` (`com.mikunime.app.id`)
- **Category:** ComponentAbuse | **CVSS:** 7.2 | **CWE:** CWE-284
- **Description:** Exported activity has no protecting permission and handles sensitive keywords.
